(86,239,'Blood typing tests are done before a person receives a blood transfusion and to check a pregnant woman&#39;s blood type. Human blood is classified, or typed, according to the presence or absence of certain markers (called antigens) on the surface of red blood cells.','en',2,'2026-05-29 23:48:05',NULL,NULL,'301FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
